---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import PageLayout from "@layouts/page.astro";
import ButtonBar from "@components/buttonbar.astro";
import ButtonLink from "@components/buttonlink.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import Head from "@components/head.astro";
import Navbar from "@components/navbar.astro";
import Socials from "@components/socials.astro";
import headshot from "@assets/headshot.jpg";
---

<PageLayout>
  <head>
    <Head title="About" permalink="/about" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Navbar />
    <Container>
      <h1>Who is this girl?</h1>
      <div class="tangent">
        <div class="sidebar">
          <div class="wrap">
            <div class="rectangle-wrap">
              <div class="rectangle"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="headshot">
              <Image src={headshot} width="800" alt="Anna Hsu headshot" />
            </div>
            <div class="fun-fact">
              <p>
                <b>Two fun facts for you:</b> I'm ambidextrous and (arguably) a foosball
                menace ✌️🤪
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bar">
            <ButtonBar>
              <ButtonLink href="https://anna.show/resume">Resume</ButtonLink>
              <ButtonLink href="https://anna.show/headshot">
                Headshot
              </ButtonLink>
            </ButtonBar>
            <Socials />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
          <p>
            Hallo! My name is Anna (she/her) and I'm a Taiwanese American
            gal based in San Francisco. I graduated from the <a
              href="https://usc.edu"
              target="_blank">University of Southern California</a
            > and <a href="https://tjhsst.fcps.edu" target="_blank"
              >Thomas Jefferson High School for Science and Technology</a
            >. I'm broadly interested in building useful products and telling
            stories that matter.
          </p>
          <p>
            At USC, I was a <a
              href="https://viterbiadmission.usc.edu/author/annahsu/"
              target="_blank">Viterbi Student Ambassador</a
            >, where they <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DABxPh2Swmq/"
              target="_blank">somehow</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DFd12seyxXw/"
              target="_blank">let</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DH9GB1XyTQn/"
              target="_blank">me</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DI1kD6hTufn/"
              target="_blank">run</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DOeHc9tCeCl/"
              target="_blank">their</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQHuw_Fjz1x/"
              target="_blank">Instagram</a
            >. I also drummed up daily shenanigans at <a
              href="https://morningtrojan.com/"
              target="_blank">Morning, Trojan</a
            > and on more than one occasion, I went <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DX6D07XpxV0/"
              target="_blank">locally</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVjiyztklJv/"
              target="_blank">viral</a
            >
            for <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWxMtZ3D3a2/"
              target="_blank">side</a
            >
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWkJDljEn_U/"
              target="_blank">quests</a
            > I went on.
          </p>
          <p>
            In my (rare) spare time, you can find me getting mistaken for a
            16-year-old while getting samples at Costco, <a
              href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/7pqZbX1kOheeGjIY5B6i6M"
              target="_blank">listening to music</a
            >, and <a
              href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/89593849"
              target="_blank">running from my life problems</a
            >. Feel free to reach out via email; I'd love to chat!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </body>
</PageLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .content {
    flex: 999 1 300px;
  }

  .tangent {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
    flex: 1 1 0;
  }

  .wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .rectangle-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .rectangle {
    background: var(--light);
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 50;
    animation: whee 1s ease forwards;
  }

  .headshot {
    z-index: 100;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
    animation: photo 1s ease forwards;

    img {
      max-width: 300px;
      height: auto;
    }
  }

  .fun-fact {
    opacity: 0;
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 999;
    background-color: var(--white);
    padding: 1rem;
    width: 16rem;
    left: 8rem;
    bottom: -2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--cutout);
    transform: rotate(3deg);
    visibility: hidden;
    transition:
      opacity 0.3s ease,
      visibility 0.3s ease;

    p {
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  .wrap:hover .fun-fact {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  @media (max-width: 374px) {
    .headshot {
      max-width: 200px;
      max-height: 200px;

      img {
        max-width: 200px;
        height: auto;
      }
    }
  }

  .bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .rectangle {
      animation: none;
      transform: rotate(6deg);
      box-shadow: var(--cutout);
    }
  }

  @keyframes photo {
    100% {
      box-shadow: var(--cutout);
    }
  }

  @keyframes whee {
    0% {
      opacity: 0%;
      transform: rotate(0deg);
    }

    100% {
      transform: rotate(6deg);
      box-shadow: var(--cutout);
    }
  }
</style>
